                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 130.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memoranda of passports, etc., possessed by Mrs. Emily
                        Jane Smith.</hi></head>
                <p>Passport issued to her father, Charles Henry Cooper, No. 4, September 12, 1885,
                    by the U. S. legation at Seoul, Korea.</p>
                <p>Passport issued to Oscar Fitzallen Smith, her husband, by Vice Consul-General
                    Willie P. Mangum, at Shanghai, February 25, 1868.</p>
                <p>Certificate of marriage issued by U. S. Consul Alex. C. Jones, at Nagasaki,
                    November 22, 1884.</p>
            </div>
